 "note": "Rams store (DF-STORE-RAMS-1147). Every price is in Rams (CURRENCY_NOTES). Prices follow the Dauntless Revived table (dyes 5,000; weapons 2,500; armour, banners and lanterns 750; sigils and flares 250); emotes are not in that table (1,000 here). Change any number here; the backend reads this file at start.",
